{"actions": [], "code_blocks": [], "content_units": ["Project Delay Communication", "This draft email provides a direct yet collaborative message to acknowledge a project delay, request a revised timeline, and ask for proposed mitigation steps.", "Draft Email for Project Update", "Subject: Project Update: [Project Name] Delay and Revised Plan Request", "Dear [Recipient Name/Team],", "We've noted the recent update regarding the delay in [specific project/task name or component]. We understand that unforeseen circumstances can arise, and we appreciate you bringing this to our attention.", "To maintain project momentum and ensure clear communication, we kindly request a revised timeline for the completion of [specific project/task name or component]. Please include updated key milestones and an anticipated new delivery date.", "Furthermore, we would appreciate it if you could share the mitigation steps your team is implementing or proposing to minimize the impact of this delay on the broader project schedule and our shared objectives. We are keen to collaborate on solutions to keep us on track as much as possible.", "Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter.", "Best regards,", "[Your Name/Team]", "Quick Actions", "- Action: [Button: Send Draft Email]  ]%20Delay%20and%20Revised%20Plan%20Request&body=Dear%20[Recipient%20Name/Team],%0A%0AWe've%20noted%20the%20recent%20update%20regarding%20the%20delay%20in%20[specific%20project/task%20name%20or%20component].%20We%20understand%20that%20unforeseen%20circumstances%20can%20arise,%20and%20we%20appreciate%20you%20bringing%20this%20to%20our%20attention.%0A%0ATo%20maintain%20project%20momentum%20and%20ensure%20clear%20communication,%20we%20kindly%20request%20a%20revised%20timeline%20for%20the%20completion%20of%20[specific%20project/task%20name%20or%20component].%20Please%20include%20updated%20key%20milestones%20and%20an%20anticipated%20new%20delivery%20date.%0A%0AFurthermore,%20we%20would%20appreciate%20it%20if%20you%20c